{"id":"n86434-1-15","stage":1,"title":"준비 · 准备","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86434-1-15-1","ko":"준비 다 됐으면 얼른 나와!","zh":"准备好了就快点出来！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"준비","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"됐으면","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐으면","audio":"/audio/d5a61b9b0e91258a650a.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"나와!","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와","audio":"/audio/3e680d9cb0a070926232.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7d